   "date_text": "1287",
   "date": "1287",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 0,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Toungoo_dynasty#0"
  },
  {
   "text": "The largest empire in the history of Southeast Asia collapsed in the 18 years following Bayinnaungs death in 1581.",
