   "date_text": "1581",
   "date": "1581",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 0,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Toungoo_dynasty#1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nyaungyan Min and his son , Anaukpetlun , succeeded in restoring a smaller , more manageable kingdom by 1622.",
