   "date": "1752",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 0,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Toungoo_dynasty#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "King Mingyi Nyo founded the First Taungoo Dynasty at Taungoo far up the Sittaung River south of Inwa towards the end of the Ava Kingdom in 1510",
